  "status_text": "The triangle's three jobs now have an exact price. Eight gates and one shared flip are enough. Lean checked a circuit that tells whether at least two of A, B and C are on and, when they are, reports whether exactly one end of AB is on and whether exactly one end of BC is on. The checked lower bound rules out seven gates under the same one-NOT cap. Constants are free, and the AND, OR and NOT gates read at most two earlier wires (L-lib-1229, L-meta-42704).",
